  "contentHtml": "<p>사운드오브뮤직 활동지는</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/150\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/evuJ/150</a></p><p>정수금 선생님의 활동지를 편집&amp;첨가했고</p><p>리미트리스 활동지는 제가 양식을 고대로 따와서 만들었습니다!</p><p>저는 소책자 모드로 A4한장에 인쇄해서줬고</p><p>관련 영상도 다 보여주기에는 지루해서 필요한 부분만 끊어서 보여줬습니다</p><p>이 구성, 틀이 정말 좋아요! &#160;정수금 선생님&#160;정말 감사합니다!&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/574b77d7a8334442fbe46393714ba65fe1d5850a?download\" data-file-name=\"사운드오브뮤직 활동지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"1900544\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D481%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20230711155935&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F574b77d7a8334442fbe46393714ba65fe1d5850a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">사운드오브뮤직 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.81MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/293121aafe9472b50d1c5c6ac7cece224a1d431a?download\" data-file-name=\"리미트리스 활동지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"3473408\" data-mimetype=\"application/vnd.hancom.hwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D481%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20230711155935&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F293121aafe9472b50d1c5c6ac7cece224a1d431a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">리미트리스 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">3.31MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eb2faec83850b81f90fda272c6ad8ff956634c0b\" class=